  "body": " What makes arc length the natural parameter?   After reparametrizing a regular curve by arc length to get , what is its speed ? Explain why that value is exactly what you should expect when the parameter itself measures distance traveled.    Speed is the rate at which distance is covered per unit of the parameter. If the parameter is distance, how much distance passes for each unit of ? You do not need to compute anything; reason from what measures.   "
