  "title": "Why no diagonal slope?",
  "body": " Why no diagonal slope?   The two partials and report only the east and north slopes. Why is it that knowing these two numbers does not, by itself, tell you the slope you would feel walking in a diagonal direction such as northeast?    A diagonal step changes and at the same time. The example above shows a surface whose coordinate slopes are both , yet which is far from flat along the line .   "
