  "title": "A hidden source at a missing point.",
  "body": " A hidden source at a missing point   On the punctured plane define Away from the origin, is harmonic: But its gradient is   On the circle , the outward unit normal is and Since ,   This does not contradict the theorem. The disk contains the origin, where is not defined. The missing point behaves like a hidden source. A theorem about smooth functions on a whole region cannot be applied across a hole in the domain.   "
