  "title": "Mean value property.",
  "body": " Mean value property   Let be harmonic on a disk containing the closed disk Then That is, the value at the center equals the average value on every circle around it, as long as the whole closed disk lies inside the domain.    Let Differentiate with respect to : On the circle of radius , the outward unit normal is and So By the divergence theorem in the plane, Since is harmonic, so Thus is constant as changes. As , the circle shrinks to the point , and by continuity Therefore every equals .   "
